From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sherif Shalaby <sherif2222222@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:40:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] camera: restore ICameraRecordingProxyListener for HALv1
 video

Android 14 dropped the recording-proxy listener and the release-frame calls,
leaving only the BUFFER_QUEUE video path, which HALv1 cameras cannot do.
Bring back the Android 13 ICameraRecordingProxy{,Listener} and the Camera
forwarding so CameraSource can receive data-callback frames again.
connectLegacy stays out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
